quired  constant treatment and yet he showed an  absolutely unbelievable level of  strength and resilience oh and of course  garp also showed himself to be a force  to be reckoned with at marineford so  with all of these things in mind i'm  inclined to believe that despite being  older garp is now probably even stronger  than he was at god valley and his level  of power surpasses that of an admiral in  the decades that followed god valley  garp demonstrated many other impressive  feats eight years after the god valley  incident he earned the name garp the  fist after absolutely wrecking qin zhao  and flattening his pointy drill-shaped  head which up to that point was known as  the strongest head in the world and it  could literally drill through an  incredibly thick layer of ice like it  was butter xinjiao was so devastated by  his defeat at the hands of garp that he  swore revenge not only against garp but  also against garp's son and grandson and  garp's defeat of xinjiao was only the  beginning garp would face off against  goldie roger multiple times between the  time of the god valley incident and  roger's death and each time garp turned  out to be a fierce opponent for the  overpowered roger pirates in fact roger  respected garp so much that he asked him  to take care of his unborn son ace after  roger's own impending death you can only  imagine how much roger must have  respected garp if he decided to entrust  his own son to the man who should have  been his mortal enemy roger clearly knew  that garp was both extremely honorable  and morally upright and also that he was  strong enough to protect ace from even  the fiercest threats about a week before  roger's public execution garp and  sengoku successfully repelled the direct  attack on marine ford by shiki the  golden lion proving once again that garp  is one of the strongest characters in  the entire world of one piece after the  death of roger garp would take ace to  don island where he was raised by curly  d'addan and where he eventually  befriended luffy and sabo garp also took  an active role in training young luffy  and ace in order to make them stronger  later on garp would also train kobe and  helmepo in their career as marines these  two then went through one of the  greatest chat formations in the history  of anime and manga and considering how  strong luffy and ace would eventually  become we have to conclude that garp is  one of the greatest instructors in all  of fiction although to be fair an  important part of garp's training regime  is almost killing his trainees on  multiple occasions but still garp would  argue that he is one of the main reasons  why luffy became as strong as he did we  can assume that garp also played a part  in training his son monkey d dragon who  would eventually become the leader of  the revolutionaries and the world's most  wanted man as i mentioned earlier during  the world shaking paramount war garp  demonstrated that he is still an  incredibly strong fighter even at his  advanced age at marine ford we see him  squaring off against the whitebeard  pirates who are determined to rescue ace  before his execution and we even see  garp punching out marco in his phoenix  form marco was at the time one of the  strongest pirates in the world and a  user of an overpowered mythical zone  devil fruit and yet garp who was already  in his mid-70s at the time appeared to  be more than a match for marco in fact  garp was clearly going easy on some of  his opponents during this battle because  he loves luffy and ace and he didn't  want either of them to get hurt when  luffy was attempting to reach ace and  save him garp stood in his way but when  it came down to actually fighting luffy  garp closed his eyes and allowed himself  to be hit by luffy and by doing this he  deliberately cleared the path for his  grandson if garp had been fighting  seriously and giving it his all  throughout the course of this battle  things would have gone a lot worse for  luffy and the pirates garp wasn't even  really fazed by luffy's direct attack  because later on he and sengoku would  face off against blackbeard and the  blackbeard pirates when ace was  ultimately killed by sakazuki garp flew  into a rage and he would have killed  sakazuki if sengoku wasn't there to hold  him down knowing everything that we know  about garb i think that he was indeed  capable of killing sakazuki and there is  a real possibility that garp is actually  stronger than the current fleet admiral  after the events of marine ford both  garp and sengoku resigned from their  positions within the marines  however the two of them resigning at the  same time at such a crucial turning  point in history would have looked  extremely bad for the world government  so the world government military  commander-in-chief kong didn't allow  them to leave the service instead they  retained their ranks and they were put  in charge of training the next  generation of marines as we saw during  the recent reverie and wano arcs garp  remains involved in marine activities  especially activities related to  diplomacy i believe that garp is  currently biding his time and that he  has a secret plan up his sleeve a plan  that likely also involves sengoku in my  opinion  garp will finally make his move against  the celestial dragons during the final  saga and it is at that time that we will  finally learn the truth about god valley  and the full extent of garp's power and  speaking of garp's power how strong is  he really we know that garp is a living  legend among the marines and one of the  strongest marines in history he was able  to go toe-to-toe against the pirate king  goldie roger on multiple occasions  together with roger he defeated the  rock's pirates he also defeated xinjiao  he slapped marco in his phoenix form and  together with sengoku he defeated cheeky  carp could have been promoted to admiral  decades ago if he had wanted to and i  think it's likely that he would actually  take all the current admirals in a fight  he has demonstrated superhuman feats of  strength on multiple occasions like  breaking walls with his fists and  effortlessly throwing a gigantic ball  and chain at the thousand sunny garp is  even said to have crushed entire  mountains with his punch he also has  exceptional stamina and durability as we  saw during the paramount war he was able  to take a direct punch from luffy in  gear second and then get up a little bit  later to fight blackbeard garp also  possesses exceptional speed and just in  general his power is highly respected by  everyone from the very top echelons of  the world government to the strongest  pirates in history like roger and  whitebeard aside from using cannonballs  and a giant ironball and chain as  weapons garp can also use both armament  hockey and observation hockey although  he hasn't been shown to be a user of  conquerors haki he is extremely  knowledgeable about it and according to  garp he could sense that luffy had the  ability to use conquerors haki ever  since he was born i believe that garp is  easily one of the top 10 strongest  living characters in one piece and  although we are yet to see the full  extent of his power i am convinced that  his true power will be revealed in the  final saga of the story i think that  garp is planning something big i think  that he will turn against the celestial  dragons when the time is right and when  this does happen we will finally learn  the truth about the infamous god valley  incident in my opinion garp truly  believes that the marines are a force  for good in the world and that they can  make the world a better place but at the  same time he knows that the world  government and the celestial dragons are  a force for evil and so in order to save  the marines and the rest of the world i  think garp will betray the world  government and i think that sengoku kobe  helmepo and others will join him in fact  i wouldn't be surprised if garp ends up  being the one who kills sakazuki in the  final arc of the story we all know that  luffy wants revenge for what happened to  ace but sakazuki being taken out by garp  would be even more poetic in my opinion  mark my words guys do not  sleep on garp he will turn out to be far  stronger and far more important to the  story than most people realize let me  know what you think how strong is garp  and where would you rank him among the  top strongest characters in the series  do you agree with me that he breaks into  the top 10 living characters and who are  your top 10 comment down below with your  thoughts and rankings if you enjoy our  one piece content and you want to see  more in the future you know what to do  leave a quick like and comment right now  and of course if you haven't subscribed  yet make this the video that you  subscribe and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications it is a  completely free way to directly support  this channel and you might think that  subscribing doesn't mean a lot but it  actually does help a whole bunch on  youtube you can also hit me up on  twitter and instagram at animeopror  thanks again to mobile legends adventure  for sponsoring this video check them out  link in the description as always thank  you guys so much for watching and until  next time see ya space cowboys
 

